---
// The level editor (docs/design/level-editor.md §5): a campaign put together stage by stage
// (scripts/level-editor.ts) and exported as a .srw64mod by the page's own compiler
// (lib/compiler, the command line's in TypeScript). The original maps, terrain, units and
// pilots it shows are the site's own exports (web/scripts/export_editor.py, the Library's
// pictures); no ROM is read. Its texts are Chinese and English for now: Japanese and
// Korean pages show the English.
